algorithm:
{
New algorithm: Compute priority as the negative absolute difference between the bin capacity and the item size, so that bins whose remaining capacity is closest to the item size are preferred.
}

function:
def priority(item: float, bins: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
    remaining = bins - item
    remaining = np.clip(remaining, 0, None)
    capacity_ratio = remaining / bins
    return -np.abs(capacity_ratio - 0.5)
